Project Overview
This project features an interactive Power BI dashboard designed to analyze Starbucks India’s comprehensive sales performance over a 10-year period. It provides granular insights into revenue streams, regional performance, and temporal trends through a polished, brand-aligned visual interface.

ETL Process & Architecture
Extract: Ingested historical sales records from the Starbucks_India_10yrs_sales.csv dataset.

Transform: Performed data cleansing, handling, and preprocessing using DataColab, alongside feature engineering to calculate key business metrics such as Profit Margin, Net Revenue, and Year-over-Year (YoY) Growth.

Load: Loaded the processed dataset into Power BI to establish the relational model and power visual analytics.

Key Features & Capabilities
Executive KPI Cards: High-level metrics tracking total Revenue, Profit, and Discounts.

Category & Regional Breakdown: Deep-dive analysis examining performance across product categories and geographical regions.

Temporal Trend Analysis: Visualizes monthly trends enhanced with gradient visuals to highlight cyclical patterns.

Dynamic Interactivity: Equipped with interactive slicers enabling users to filter and slice data for dynamic, targeted insights.

Thematic UI Design: Styled using a premium green-gold Starbucks visual theme.

Tools & Technologies Used
Visualization & Modeling: Power BI, DAX, Power Query

Data Processing & Cleansing: DataColab, Excel / CSV


